{
 "about": "SRV-138: the secret shapes a transcript must never store. Synthetic: each value is generated by the test from its template with a seeded random generator ({A:n} mixed alphanumerics, {U:n} upper case and digits, {L:n} lower case and digits, {B:n} base64 characters), so no file holds a token-shaped string and nothing here was ever a credential. `secret` is the part that must not reach the disk.",
